<div class="project__info">
  <div class="project__info-L">
    <p class="big">
      As executive producer and director, I ran every stage of this sports
      documentary series, from the first pitch to the final edit.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fear None follows the Richland High School football team from number one
      prospects to state champions. I worked with the team and coaches to get
      access few outsiders get: fly-on-the-wall videography, microphones on
      players, and interviews with students and coaches.
    </p>
    <p>
      I traveled with the team and shot hundreds of hours of footage. Then I
      spent two months editing it into six one-hour episodes, which aired on the
      sports network SWX in 2017 and 2018.
    </p>
  </div>

